// gomachine 이 한 번만 만드는 사용자 파일이다 (이미 있으면 덮어쓰지 않는다). 프로젝트에 맞게 고쳐 써도 된다.
// 생성 모델(models/*.ts)이 쓰는 axios 모양 fetch 래퍼: get / post / put / patch / del 은 { data, status } 를 돌려준다.
// 기본 주소는 VITE_API_BASE_URL (없으면 '/api'), 토큰은 setTokenProvider 로 바꿀 수 있다 (기본 localStorage 'token').
// HTTP 에러(2xx 아님)는 HttpError 로 던진다. Go 의 code 에러(HTTP 200)는 models/contract.ts 가 ApiError 로 던진다.

export interface ApiResponse<T> {
  data: T;
  status: number;
}

export interface RequestConfig {
  params?: object;
  data?: unknown;
  headers?: Record<string, string>;
}

export class HttpError extends Error {
  readonly status: number;
  readonly fieldErrors: Record<string, string>;
  readonly body: unknown;

  constructor(status: number, message: string, fieldErrors: Record<string, string> = {}, body?: unknown) {
    super(message);
    this.name = 'HttpError';
    this.status = status;
    this.fieldErrors = fieldErrors;
    this.body = body;
  }
}

const env = (import.meta as { env?: Record<string, string | undefined> }).env;
let baseUrl: string = env?.VITE_API_BASE_URL ?? '/api';

let tokenProvider: () => string | null = () =>
  typeof localStorage === 'undefined' ? null : localStorage.getItem('token');

let unauthorizedHandler: (() => void) | null = null;

/** 요청 주소 앞부분 (기본 VITE_API_BASE_URL 또는 '/api'). */
export function setBaseUrl(url: string): void {
  baseUrl = url;
}

/** Authorization: Bearer 에 쓸 토큰을 돌려주는 함수 (없으면 null). */
export function setTokenProvider(fn: () => string | null): void {
  tokenProvider = fn;
}

/** 401 응답을 받았을 때 부를 함수 (예: 로그아웃 처리). */
export function setUnauthorizedHandler(fn: (() => void) | null): void {
  unauthorizedHandler = fn;
}

function query(params?: object): string {
  if (!params) return '';
  const q = new URLSearchParams();
  for (const [key, value] of Object.entries(params)) {
    if (value === undefined || value === null || value === '') continue;
    q.append(key, String(value));
  }
  const s = q.toString();
  return s ? `?${s}` : '';
}

async function send<T>(method: string, url: string, body: unknown, cfg: RequestConfig = {}): Promise<ApiResponse<T>> {
  const isForm = typeof FormData !== 'undefined' && body instanceof FormData;
  const isJson = body !== undefined && !isForm;
  const token = tokenProvider();
  let payload: BodyInit | undefined;
  if (isForm) payload = body as FormData;
  else if (isJson) payload = JSON.stringify(body);
  const res = await fetch(`${baseUrl}${url}${query(cfg.params)}`, {
    method,
    headers: {
      ...(isJson ? { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' } : {}),
      ...(token ? { Authorization: `Bearer ${token}` } : {}),
      ...cfg.headers,
    },
    body: payload,
  });
  const text = await res.text();
  let data: unknown = undefined;
  if (text) {
    try {
      data = JSON.parse(text);
    } catch {
      data = text;
    }
  }
  if (!res.ok) {
    if (res.status === 401 && unauthorizedHandler) {
      unauthorizedHandler();
    }
    const err = (typeof data === 'object' && data !== null ? data : {}) as {
      message?: string;
      code?: string;
      error?: string;
      fieldErrors?: Record<string, string>;
    };
    throw new HttpError(res.status, err.message ?? err.error ?? err.code ?? `HTTP ${res.status}`, err.fieldErrors ?? {}, data);
  }
  return { data: data as T, status: res.status };
}

export const get = <T>(url: string, cfg?: RequestConfig) => send<T>('GET', url, undefined, cfg);
export const post = <T>(url: string, body?: unknown, cfg?: RequestConfig) => send<T>('POST', url, body, cfg);
export const put = <T>(url: string, body?: unknown, cfg?: RequestConfig) => send<T>('PUT', url, body, cfg);
export const patch = <T>(url: string, body?: unknown, cfg?: RequestConfig) => send<T>('PATCH', url, body, cfg);
export const del = <T>(url: string, cfg?: RequestConfig) => send<T>('DELETE', url, cfg?.data, cfg);
